summary:
  A picture of the artist found after a song search timed out is cached
  like a final answer.

history:
  A found picture never expires from the cache. When the request that
  timed out was the one that had the cover, filing the artist's picture
  leaves the song without its cover until the panel restarts. A stand-in
  met after a transient failure is shown and not filed, and the lookup gets
  its one later attempt. This mutant files it.

target:
  package/contents/ui/ArtworkEngine.qml

find:
              var sure = kind === "track" || !sawTransient;

replace:
              var sure = kind !== "" || !sawTransient;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_artworkengine.qml::test_a_stand_in_found_after_a_timeout_is_shown_and_the_song_is_asked_for_again.
  Line-neutral.
